<Base lang="en" title="Privacy" description="Privacy information for ploos.no."><section class="wrap hero">
<h1>Privacy</h1><p class="lead">Ploos AS is the controller of personal information sent through the contact form.</p>
<h2>Information and purposes</h2><p>Name, reply address, subject and message are processed to respond to enquiries. Necessary technical data is used to prevent abuse.</p>
<h2>Providers</h2><p>The website is hosted on GitHub Pages. When enabled, Cloudflare Workers and Turnstile process form submissions, and Proton Mail delivers and stores the messages. Processing agreements, retention and potential transfers outside the EEA must be reviewed before activation.</p>
<h2>Retention and rights</h2><p>Enquiries are kept only for follow-up or mandatory legal purposes. You can request access, correction and erasure where applicable.</p><p>Verified legal contact details and retention procedures must be added before production launch.</p>
</section></Base>
